{"id":"vod_sn_35720","vodId":"35720","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"悠哉日常大王第一季","name_cn":"悠哉日常大王第一季","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/0a89a0abbff4496c25d2859f83ed0bc1.jpg"},"summary":"在一个远离都市喧嚣、为青山绿水所环绕的乡村，当地的旭丘分校仅有四名学生。越谷家的兄妹三人，分别是中三的卓、中二的小鞠（阿澄佳奈 配音）和中一的越谷夏海（佐仓绫音 配音），另有宫内家的小女儿小一的莲华（小岩井ことり 配音）。莲华的姐姐一穗（名冢佳织 配音）是分校的唯一教师，因学生稀少，因此四人和在一个班，日常课程也全部以自习为主。在某个晴朗时节，正读五年级的东京女孩一条萤（村川梨衣 配音）因父母工作的关系搬到旭丘。对喧哗吵闹的都市节奏习以为常，风格迥异的乡村生活带给萤萤前所未有的新奇体验。虽然有着诸多不便，但在这个时间仿佛凝滞的所在，悠然自得的好心情慢慢升起……　　本片根据あっと的同名漫画改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:37:08","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/XVFyTgg6bY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0Y19Echgtn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/k8WXxjbXM21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RTRhhcvrjz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QYKKETp69v1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cENY906BTE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5cq1XVxdDt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vvvxs0SygZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DQCg8VV7Nw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/t1Gg6dtykZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bHjXgPQC3i1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/b76xf7c9aF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qpwPTKqA2Z1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:31.551Z"}